{"id":"7e636ff8dc7682de","group":"90","path":"90/90-thm-tarski-undefinability.md","title":"Tarski's Undefinability Theorem","display":"thm-tarski-undefinability — Tarski's Undefinability Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-thm-tarski-undefinability","aliases":["90-thm-tarski-undefinability"],"display":"thm-tarski-undefinability — Tarski's Undefinability Theorem","depends_on":["[[90-df-tarski-undefinability]]","[[90-df-diagonal-lemma]]","[[90-df-soundness-theory]]","[[90-thm-diagonal-lemma-formal]]","[[90-df-truth-definition]]","[[90-df-arithmetic-language]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-thm-tarski-undefinability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-thm-tarski-undefinability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-tarski-undefinability — Tarski's Undefinability Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ee92d67ceb6220d0\" href=\"?note=ee92d67ceb6220d0\" title=\"90-df-tarski-undefinability\">90-df-tarski-undefinability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f57084ad3c1a7029\" href=\"?note=f57084ad3c1a7029\" title=\"90-df-diagonal-lemma\">90-df-diagonal-lemma</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a14c33ea0c47a173\" href=\"?note=a14c33ea0c47a173\" title=\"90-df-soundness-theory\">90-df-soundness-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"34b9d9e028267d9d\" href=\"?note=34b9d9e028267d9d\" title=\"90-thm-diagonal-lemma-formal\">90-thm-diagonal-lemma-formal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f63672a7ac0e50d2\" href=\"?note=f63672a7ac0e50d2\" title=\"90-df-truth-definition\">90-df-truth-definition</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"278a6c2cfc6160a3\" href=\"?note=278a6c2cfc6160a3\" title=\"90-df-arithmetic-language\">90-df-arithmetic-language</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_{\\mathrm{arith}}\">\\(S_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\)</span> (first-order arithmetic signature)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{arith}}=\\mathbb N_{\\mathrm{arith}}\">\\(\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{arith}}=\\mathbb N_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\)</span> (standard structure, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"278a6c2cfc6160a3\" href=\"?note=278a6c2cfc6160a3\" title=\"90-df-arithmetic-language\">90-df-arithmetic-language</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_{\\mathrm{arith}}\">\\(S_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\)</span>-theory)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:\\operatorname{Expr}(S_{\\mathrm{arith}})\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(g:\\operatorname{Expr}(S_{\\mathrm{arith}})\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d:\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\operatorname{Expr}(S_{\\mathrm{arith}})\">\\(d:\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\operatorname{Expr}(S_{\\mathrm{arith}})\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}},g,d}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}},g,d}(T)\\)</span> (diagonalization adequacy, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"f57084ad3c1a7029\" href=\"?note=f57084ad3c1a7029\" title=\"90-df-diagonal-lemma\">90-df-diagonal-lemma</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sound}_{\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sound}_{\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(T)\\)</span> (standard-model soundness, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"a14c33ea0c47a173\" href=\"?note=a14c33ea0c47a173\" title=\"90-df-soundness-theory\">90-df-soundness-theory</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TarskiUndef}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}},g}\">\\(\\mathrm{TarskiUndef}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}},g}\\)</span> (undefinability predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"ee92d67ceb6220d0\" href=\"?note=ee92d67ceb6220d0\" title=\"90-df-tarski-undefinability\">90-df-tarski-undefinability</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}tarski\\text{-}undefinability}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}},g,d}(T)\n\\land\\mathrm{Sound}_{\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(T)\n\\Bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathrm{TarskiUndef}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}},g}(\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{arith}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}tarski\\text{-}undefinability}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}},g,d}(T)\n\\land\\mathrm{Sound}_{\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(T)\n\\Bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathrm{TarskiUndef}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}},g}(\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{arith}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Proof\">[Proof]</h2>\n<p>反设存在满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TruthDef}\">\\(\\mathrm{TruthDef}\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau(v)\">\\(\\tau(v)\\)</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\tau(v)\">\\(\\neg\\tau(v)\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"34b9d9e028267d9d\" href=\"?note=34b9d9e028267d9d\" title=\"90-thm-diagonal-lemma-formal\">90-thm-diagonal-lemma-formal</a>，取得句子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\">\\(\\psi\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash\\psi\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\tau[\\overline{g(\\psi)}/v]\">\\(T\\vdash\\psi\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\tau[\\overline{g(\\psi)}/v]\\)</span>。可靠性使该双条件在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{arith}}\">\\(\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\)</span> 中为真；真值定义又使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\models\\tau[\\overline{g(\\psi)}/v]\">\\(\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\models\\tau[\\overline{g(\\psi)}/v]\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\models\\psi\">\\(\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\models\\psi\\)</span>，二者矛盾。对角化充分性提供所需同一有效编码和句子，故满足真值定义的全部适用条件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>若候选 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 定义全部真句编码，对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\tau(v)\">\\(\\neg\\tau(v)\\)</span> 使用对角引理得到句子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash\\lambda\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\tau(\\overline{g(\\lambda)})\">\\(T\\vdash\\lambda\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\tau(\\overline{g(\\lambda)})\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{arith}}\">\\(\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\)</span> 的可靠性把该等价送到标准模型，而真理定义给出相反等价，遂矛盾。</li>\n<li>条件显式排除了任意非有效编号和不可靠证明理论；外部元语言真谓词仍然存在，对象语言与元语言层级不能混同。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Proof","text":"[Proof]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-tarski-undefinability","status":"resolved","id":"ee92d67ceb6220d0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-tarski-undefinability]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-diagonal-lemma","status":"resolved","id":"f57084ad3c1a7029","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-diagonal-lemma]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-soundness-theory","status":"resolved","id":"a14c33ea0c47a173","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-soundness-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-thm-diagonal-lemma-formal","status":"resolved","id":"34b9d9e028267d9d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-thm-diagonal-lemma-formal]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-truth-definition","status":"resolved","id":"f63672a7ac0e50d2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-truth-definition]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-arithmetic-language","status":"resolved","id":"278a6c2cfc6160a3","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-arithmetic-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-arithmetic-language","status":"resolved","id":"278a6c2cfc6160a3","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{arith}}=\\mathbb N_{\\mathrm{arith}}$ (standard structure, see [[90-df-arithmetic-language]])","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-diagonal-lemma","status":"resolved","id":"f57084ad3c1a7029","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}},g,d}(T)$ (diagonalization adequacy, see [[90-df-diagonal-lemma]])","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-soundness-theory","status":"resolved","id":"a14c33ea0c47a173","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sound}_{\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(T)$ (standard-model soundness, see [[90-df-soundness-theory]])","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-tarski-undefinability","status":"resolved","id":"ee92d67ceb6220d0","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TarskiUndef}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}},g}$ (undefinability predicate, see [[90-df-tarski-undefinability]])","embed":false},{"target":"90-thm-diagonal-lemma-formal","status":"resolved","id":"34b9d9e028267d9d","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Proof]","excerpt":"反设存在满足 $\\mathrm{TruthDef}$ 的 $\\tau(v)$。对 $\\neg\\tau(v)$ 使用 [[90-thm-diagonal-lemma-formal]]，取得句子 $\\psi$ 满足 $T\\vdash\\psi\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\tau[\\overline{g(\\psi)}/v]$。可靠性使该双条件在 $\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{arith}}$ 中为真；真值定义又使 $\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\models\\tau[\\overline{g(\\psi)}/v]$ 当且仅当 $\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\models\\psi$，二者矛盾。对角化充分性提供所需同一有效编码和句子，故满足真值定义的全部适用条件。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S_{\\mathrm{arith}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{arith}}=\\mathbb N_{\\mathrm{arith}}","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"S_{\\mathrm{arith}}","display":false},{"tex":"g:\\operatorname{Expr}(S_{\\mathrm{arith}})\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"d:\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\operatorname{Expr}(S_{\\mathrm{arith}})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}},g,d}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sound}_{\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TarskiUndef}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}},g}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}tarski\\text{-}undefinability}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}},g,d}(T)\n\\land\\mathrm{Sound}_{\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(T)\n\\Bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathrm{TarskiUndef}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}},g}(\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{arith}}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TruthDef}","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau(v)","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\tau(v)","display":false},{"tex":"\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"T\\vdash\\psi\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\tau[\\overline{g(\\psi)}/v]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{arith}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\models\\tau[\\overline{g(\\psi)}/v]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\models\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\tau(v)","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"T\\vdash\\lambda\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\tau(\\overline{g(\\lambda)})","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{arith}}","display":false}],"bytes":2516,"backlinks":[{"id":"ee92d67ceb6220d0","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"本文件只定义“同一算术语言中没有公式定义标准模型全部真句编码”这一性质；其成立性由 [[90-thm-tarski-undefinability]] 在显式对角化与可靠性条件下证明。"},{"id":"32c1f47762a7f658","anchor":"ref-131","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-thm-diagonal-closure.md]]\n[[90-thm-diagonal-lemma-formal.md]]\n[[90-thm-first-incompleteness.md]]\n[[90-thm-fixed-point-algorithm.md]]\n[[90-thm-kleene-second-recursion.md]]\n[[90-thm-min-closure-rec.md]]\n[[90-thm-myhill-operator.md]]\n[[90-thm-recursion-theorem.md]]\n[[90-thm-recursive-set-representation.md]]\n[[90-thm-second-incompleteness.md]]\n[[90-thm-smullyan-diagonal.md]]\n[[90-thm-tarski-undefinability.md]]"}],"outgoing":["ee92d67ceb6220d0","f57084ad3c1a7029","a14c33ea0c47a173","34b9d9e028267d9d","f63672a7ac0e50d2","278a6c2cfc6160a3"]}